      "comment" : "A label for the standard deviation of the paired values within the time window.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "Workout" : {
      "comment" : "The title of a button that opens a workout interface.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "Workout saved" : {
      "comment" : "A section header for a workout that has been saved.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "Works with devices using the standard Bluetooth Heart Rate (0x180D), Pulse Oximeter (0x1822), or Health Thermometer (0x1809) profiles, such as most chest straps and standards-compliant pulse oximeters. Some rings only measure on request through a vendor protocol. HeartSync has candidate support for one such protocol (YCBT): once the ring has identified itself, it offers heart-rate, blood-oxygen, and blood-pressure measurements, and can import the readings the ring stored on its own. Ring blood pressure and temperature are saved as estimates. Use Run Bluetooth diagnostics from a device's menu to see what it sends." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the Bluetooth features of the app.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "Write Bluetooth data to Health" : {
      "comment" : "A toggle that enables the app to write data from the user's Bluetooth sensors to Health.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "Writing to Health shares readings from your Bluetooth sensors with your other apps. Only directly measured values are written — nothing HeartSync estimated ever enters your health record." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the data that is written to Health.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "You" : {
      "comment" : "A heading for the user's profile.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "You can decline individual permissions. HeartSync will keep the account connected and mark only that data unavailable. The OAuth token stays in this device's Keychain; the client-side flow requires authorization again after it expires, and HeartSync warns you before that happens." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the permissions that the user has granted to",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "You only do this once per device. After that, connecting is a single sign-in." : {
      "comment" : "A footer that describes the one-time setup step.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "You sign in on Oura's site and choose which read-only data to share; HeartSync never sees your password." : {

    },
    "Your data" : {
      "comment" : "A section that describes the user's data.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "Your notes" : {
      "comment" : "A heading for the user's notes in the Save Comparison Session view.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "Your stored measurements have not been changed." : {
      "comment" : "A description of why the error message is not a warning.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "Zero" : {
      "comment" : "Label for the baseline line in the difference chart.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "Zero difference" : {
      "comment" : "Label for the baseline value of zero difference on the Bland-Altman plot.",
